    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>EventListener</code></a> to listen to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> updates triggered by the\n<a href=\"ConfigDataEnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigDataEnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a>.",
